        {
          "properties": {
            "paragraphs": [
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "43,824 hourly readings from 1 January 2010 to 31 December 2014: fine particles (PM2.5, micrograms per cubic metre) measured at the US embassy in Beijing, with the weather at each hour: temperature, dew point, pressure, wind direction and cumulated wind speed, and hours of snow and rain. PM2.5 is missing for 2,067 hours (4.7%); those hours keep an empty PM2.5 and fall in the band No reading.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#E8ECF1"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "How to use it",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "15pt",
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "color": "#E8ECF1"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Open the Filters pane on the right (the funnel tab) to filter by category or date; the selection applies to every page. Click a bar, a slice or a point to cross-filter the other charts, and hover over one to see a small summary card.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#E8ECF1"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Data source",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "15pt",
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "color": "#E8ECF1"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "UCI Machine Learning Repository, Beijing PM2.5 Data (Liang et al., 2015), licence CC BY 4.0. https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/381. Prepared: the date was assembled from year, month and day; concentration bands follow the US EPA breakpoints (applied to hourly readings, which is an approximation of the 24-hour standard); the heating season is 15 November to 15 March, when Beijing's central heating runs; wind directions were spelled out (cv means calm or variable).",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#E8ECF1"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Measures",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "15pt",
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "color": "#E8ECF1"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Hours of data = COUNTROWS(BeijingPM25)",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#E8ECF1"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Average PM2.5 = AVERAGE(BeijingPM25[PM25])",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#E8ECF1"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Share of hours above 55 = DIVIDE(CALCULATE(COUNTROWS(BeijingPM25), BeijingPM25[PM25] > 55.4), CALCULATE(COUNTROWS(BeijingPM25), NOT(ISBLANK(BeijingPM25[PM25]))))",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#E8ECF1"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Average temperature = AVERAGE(BeijingPM25[Temperature_C])",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#E8ECF1"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Worst hour = MAX(BeijingPM25[PM25])",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#E8ECF1"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Average wind speed = AVERAGE(BeijingPM25[Wind_speed])",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#E8ECF1"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
